70-fifth one refuses before any forge call. Each occurrence waives only checks
71-with that exact name, every check not named must still be green, and the head
72-is still bound. Its single-use
73-twin, an attended --allow-missing <check-name>, follows the same rules for one
74-required check that has not reported: it waives only that exact name, still
--
